/* MP Loc HighStreet More2 — 高街秤房增补（Event 13-22 + 季令）
   Hub 只留三个二级入口（前街 / 铺面 / 后仓）与季令，每个二级页列 3-4 个事件；
   完成后由 $mpDone_HighStreet_13..22 显示余波并隐藏入口。
   每个事件再拆「接近 → 结果」两页：接近页只写处境与两个动作，不结算；
   结果页按 $mpHighStreetEv13..22 分成功/失败，失败只加压力/疲劳/疼痛，0 钱 0 线索 0 旗标。 */

:: MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet to ($mpLocEvents_HighStreet or 0)>>
高街北段有间旧秤房，门脸窄得只容两人并肩，行会把它作了第二处候事的地方。屋里沿墙钉着窄木架，十只旧铜盘各压一张纸条，写着假币、火警、债户、学徒、夜市、车马、当铺、账目、艺人和钟楼。执事按轻重把盘子排过，往最末的空盘里丢一粒石子：「明面上的事铺子自己扛，暗地里的归巡夜，夹在中间的就在这两架盘子里。」西架摆前街的，中架摆铺面的，东架摆后仓的。
<br><br>
<<if $mpDone_HighStreet_Season>>本季的布防已经收尾，棚绳和风灯都过了手。<<else>>换季之前，街面的棚、幌、灯和排水沟还等着重新过一遍。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回候事房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去前街拱廊 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Front]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<link [[去看行会铺面 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Middle]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[转入后仓与钟楼 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Rear]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<link [[换季清点存货 (0:06)|MP Loc HighStreet Season Extra]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<mpspringicon>><<link [[换季布防再走一遍 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet Season Extra 2]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet More2 Front [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet to ($mpLocEvents_HighStreet or 0)>>
西架的四只铜盘挨着门口，盘底的纸条被日头晒得发脆。假币、债户、夜市和车马的事都落在前街与拱廊之间，铺门一开，来往的人都能看见。执事敲了敲架沿：「这四件办得快，街面松得也快。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房再挑一件 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<link [[支起夜市摊 (0:06)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 11]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpDone_HighStreet_13>>柜上那碗假币已换成一张来路字条。<br><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[验假币案 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 13]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_HighStreet_15>>堵门的债主拿了准话散去。<br><<else>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[应付堵门债 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 15]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_HighStreet_17>>夜市两摊各认了赔数。<br><<else>><<link [[劝开夜市两摊 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 17]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_HighStreet_18>>翻覆的粮车已挪过斜坡。<<else>><<runicon>><<link [[处置翻覆的粮车 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 18]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet More2 Middle [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet to ($mpLocEvents_HighStreet or 0)>>
中层的三只铜盘蒙着一层薄灰，盘底纸条压的全是铺面里的活。钟表铺后间、行会那张长账桌、拱廊下的卖艺人，都在同一条街面上，抬头就能望见。执事把罩灯往这边偏了偏：「这三件不在明面，也不全在暗处。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpDone_HighStreet_16>>偷师的图卷已交回铺里。<br><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[查学徒偷师 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 16]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_HighStreet_20>>行会的三本账已补齐。<br><<else>><<link [[应付行会的查账 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 20]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_HighStreet_21>>拱廊的消防道重新空了出来。<<else>><<link [[安顿拱廊下的艺人 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 21]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet More2 Rear [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet to ($mpLocEvents_HighStreet or 0)>>
东架的三只铜盘靠里，盘底的纸条都带一点潮气。布庄后仓、当铺后窗和钟楼，这几处离街心远，出了事也传得慢。执事把一盏罩灯挪到架前：「这三件办得慢，可办成一件，能顶前街三件。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回秤房去 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<link [[登钟楼传信号 (0:06)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 12]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpDone_HighStreet_14>>布庄后仓的火路已经断开。<br><<else>><<runicon>><<link [[扑救火情 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 14]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_HighStreet_19>>当铺的封柜告示揭了下来。<br><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[查当铺失窃案 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 19]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_HighStreet_22>>钟楼的裂缝已量过并补料。<<else>><<link [[查看钟楼那道裂纹 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 22]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 13 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet to ($mpLocEvents_HighStreet or 0)>><<set _sera to (mpNpcMet("Sera") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet)) ? "塞拉" : "修表师">><<set _lin to (mpNpcMet("Lynne") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet)) ? "林恩" : "守夜人">>
清早的杂货行刚卸下门板，柜台上摆着一只粗陶碗，碗里十几枚铜板边缘沾着面粉。执事拈起一枚在耳边一弹，声音发闷，像敲在干木头上。「晌午之前，得有个来路。」<<print _sera>>把自带的黑石板和一小瓶醋搁在碗边，说铅芯假钱过手会留下灰痕；后巷口，<<print _lin>>朝骡子局的方向偏了偏头。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[验币追来路 (0:12)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 13 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpHighStreetEv13 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv13 to "fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 60>><<link [[兑下这枚假币 (0:10)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 13 After]]>><<pass 10>><<money -60>><<set $mpHighStreetEv13 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">兑下这枚假币 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 13 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpHighStreetEv13 is "fail">>晌午的钟敲过，柜上的假币还没分出成色。主顾等得不耐烦，索性绕去了别家；执事再来问时，你只报得出几枚铜板的分量，来路仍旧断在后巷那顶卷走的毡子上。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><<else>><<set $mpDone_HighStreet_13 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0) + 1)>>这批假币终于有了说法：成色、来路和换手的时辰都记进了行会的字条。杂货行把假钱挑出来另装一袋，柜上的铜板重新过了一遍秤；执事临走时压了张条子，写明由行会登记。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退回候事房 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[回到高街总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 14 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet to ($mpLocEvents_HighStreet or 0)>><<set _sera to (mpNpcMet("Sera") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet)) ? "塞拉" : "修表师">><<set _lin to (mpNpcMet("Lynne") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet)) ? "林恩" : "守夜人">>
傍晚，布庄后仓的油布先冒了烟，橘红的光从小窗里透出来。风从巷口灌进来，把烟贴着屋檐往拱廊里压。执事拽住还想往里冲的老板：「先断火路，再救货。」<<print _lin>>在井边把水桶排成一列，<<print _sera>>已经把邻铺的灯油搬到街对面，湿麻袋是从井台边现取的。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<runicon>><<link [[冲进后仓抢货 (0:14)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 14 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 0) gte 11000>><<set $mpHighStreetEv14 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv14 to "fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 90 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>><<link [[拆棚断火路 (0:12)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 14 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($money or 0) gte 90>><<money -90>><<else>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<set $mpHighStreetEv14 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">拆棚断火路 (0:12)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 14 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpHighStreetEv14 is "fail">>火头顺着棚架压过来，伙计们拎着水桶来回跑，烟把整条后巷熏得睁不开眼。等火势退下去，老板蹲在被水泡胀的账本前，一句话也没说，邻铺的墙也熏黑了一片。<<stress 6>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 2>><<else>><<set $mpDone_HighStreet_14 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0) + 1)>>后仓的火被压在水线以内，能搬的货都搬到了街心，邻铺的墙还是白的。棚架拆开之后，风从缺口穿过去，火路总算断了。老板抱着账本蹲在台阶上，半晌才想起递来一碗凉水。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退回候事房 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[回到高街总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 15 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet to ($mpLocEvents_HighStreet or 0)>><<set _lin to (mpNpcMet("Lynne") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet)) ? "林恩" : "守夜人">>
三个债主一早就堵住杂货行的门口：一个坐在门槛上压着帽檐，一个抱着账本敲封皮，第三个只用木尺敲自己的掌心。执事从行会搬来三张矮凳，把账本接过去慢慢翻。<<print _lin>>站在街对面转铜哨，说堵门过了时辰，巡夜就能清场。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[对账缓住债主 (0:14)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 15 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpHighStreetEv15 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv15 to "fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 100>><<link [[先垫钱平账 (0:10)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 15 After]]>><<pass 10>><<money -100>><<set $mpHighStreetEv15 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">先垫钱平账 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 15 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpHighStreetEv15 is "fail">>债主们在门口坐到日头偏西，谁也没拿到准话。抱账本的那个把页脚按出褶皱，帽檐下的那位把门槛堵得更实；老板把脸别向柜台里侧，街坊只好绕着走。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><<else>><<set $mpDone_HighStreet_15 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0) + 1)>>三笔账终于有了章程：本钱先还，利钱折成秋后的货，门口的人也就散了。坐门槛的债主把帽檐抬了抬，抱账本的合上簿子；执事在账尾画了个押，街口的日头正好挪过拱廊。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退回候事房 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[回到高街总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 16 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet to ($mpLocEvents_HighStreet or 0)>><<set _sera to (mpNpcMet("Sera") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet)) ? "塞拉" : "修表师">><<set _lin to (mpNpcMet("Lynne") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet)) ? "林恩" : "守夜人">>
钟表铺后间只点一盏小灯，工作台上的绒布掀开，露出一块空木槽，槽里本该压着画到一半的擒纵图。<<print _sera>>把灯挪近：「最要紧的那半格，我故意写错。」门口，小学徒劈柴的斧子停了半拍；<<print _lin>>说昨夜见他在后巷和一个穿灰外套的人说话，手里捏着一小卷纸。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查学徒工具箱 (0:12)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 16 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($science or 0) gte 220 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpHighStreetEv16 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv16 to "fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[私下劝学徒 (0:14)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 16 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpHighStreetEv16 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv16 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 16 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set _sera to (mpNpcMet("Sera") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet)) ? "塞拉" : "修表师">>
<<if $mpHighStreetEv16 is "fail">>后间里的灯烧到半夜，事情却越理越乱。小学徒把斧子立回墙根，什么也没说；<<print _sera>>把绒布盖回木槽，执事把空茶碗推到桌角，谁也没再提那个穿灰外套的人。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><<else>><<set $mpDone_HighStreet_16 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0) + 1)>>那半张抄坏的图终于有了下落，错的那半格果然被人用炭笔圈了出来。小学徒把纸卷交到<<print _sera>>手里，手背上的纸伤还没结痂；执事记下灰外套的样貌，说这条线还要往后摸。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退回候事房 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[回到高街总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 17 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet to ($mpLocEvents_HighStreet or 0)>><<set _lin to (mpNpcMet("Lynne") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet)) ? "林恩" : "守夜人">>
夜市刚过半，中段两个烤物摊就打了起来：炭灰倒进油锅，油星溅了翻串的伙计，木桌被掀，铁签撒了一地。<<print _lin>>用肩膀顶开看热闹的人，回头喊你先关炉子。斜对面，杂货行老板的钱箱翻在阴沟边，铜板滚了一地。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<runicon>><<link [[挤进人堆拉架 (0:14)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 17 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>><<set $mpHighStreetEv17 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv17 to "fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[吹哨召巡夜 (0:10)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 17 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpHighStreetEv17 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv17 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 17 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpHighStreetEv17 is "fail">>两家人隔着一炉炭火互相瞪着，谁也不肯先认赔。等巡夜赶到，炉子都熄了，铁签子还横在泥里冒着细烟；老板的钱箱磕掉一角，看热闹的人这才慢慢散开。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 2>><<else>><<set $mpDone_HighStreet_17 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0) + 1)>>两家的炉门先后扣上，掀桌的那个被按回凳子，巡夜从两头合过来。摊主们各自认了赔数，老板把钱箱从阴沟边拖回来，箱角磕掉一块，倒也还锁得住。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退回候事房 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[回到高街总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 18 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet to ($mpLocEvents_HighStreet or 0)>><<set _sera to (mpNpcMet("Sera") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet)) ? "塞拉" : "修表师">><<set _lin to (mpNpcMet("Lynne") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet)) ? "林恩" : "守夜人">>
正午，一辆运粮马车在拱廊斜坡上翻了，车辕折断，粮袋滚了一街。车夫被压在车板下，只露出半条腿；拉车的马被套绳缠住，前蹄刨着石板。<<print _lin>>按住马头，<<print _sera>>蹲下去解绳结，用的是给人修钟时随身的那把小钳，后头的车队已经堵到巷口。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<runicon>><<link [[抬车救出车夫 (0:14)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 18 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 280 or ($physique or 0) gte 11000>><<set $mpHighStreetEv18 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv18 to "fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[先引开惊马 (0:12)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 18 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>><<set $mpHighStreetEv18 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv18 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 18 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpHighStreetEv18 is "fail">>车板压得太实，人手一时凑不齐，事情拖到了日头偏西。马又挣了一下，套绳勒进脖颈；粮袋上的麦粒被晒得发白，街心堵成一条线，后头的车队按着铃也没人让路。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 3>><<else>><<set $mpDone_HighStreet_18 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0) + 1)>>车上的粮袋卸下一半，车板一轻就被掀了起来。车夫被拖到路边，腿还能动；马也牵到井台边饮了水。后头的车队一辆辆挪过斜坡，老板按袋点了数，塞给你三十个铜板。<<money 30>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退回候事房 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[回到高街总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 19 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet to ($mpLocEvents_HighStreet or 0)>><<set _sera to (mpNpcMet("Sera") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet)) ? "塞拉" : "修表师">><<set _lin to (mpNpcMet("Lynne") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet)) ? "林恩" : "守夜人">>
当铺后窗的窗棂断了两根，断口朝里，窗栓上却抹着一层薄油。老经纪人坐在铁栅后头，说丢的是一只死当的银挂锁，行会封柜的告示只差盖印。<<print _sera>>把工具箱里的镊子搁在窗台：「撬窗的人，未必是从外头进来的。」<<print _lin>>在后巷墙根捡到半枚铜扣。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[验窗上的撬痕 (0:12)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 19 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpHighStreetEv19 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv19 to "fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[守一夜等贼 (0:16)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 19 After]]>><<pass 16>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpHighStreetEv19 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv19 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 19 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpHighStreetEv19 is "fail">>夜露把鞋印的纹路糊成一片，柜上的封条照旧贴了上去。老经纪人把典当簿合上，没有多问，只把灯芯剪短了一截；等赎当的人排到门口，柜门还锁着，后巷的墙根又湿了一层。<<stress 6>><<tiredness 4>><<pain 1>><<else>><<set $mpDone_HighStreet_19 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0) + 1)>>银挂锁的下落终于查清，封柜的告示揭了下来。老经纪人隔着铁栅把典当簿翻回那一页，又把四十个铜板数到你手边；后巷的脚印还在，只是已经没人再去看它。<<money 40>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退回候事房 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[回到高街总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 20 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet to ($mpLocEvents_HighStreet or 0)>>
行会查账的日子来得比往常早。三本账簿并排在长桌上，每本旁边压着一把铜尺。执事从末页往前翻，翻到某一笔，铜尺往纸上一压：「这半个月的货走得太整齐了。」老板的账房低着头，把算盘珠子一颗颗拨回去，拨得很慢。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[连夜理清旧账 (0:14)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 20 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpHighStreetEv20 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv20 to "fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[找执事说情 (0:12)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 20 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpHighStreetEv20 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv20 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 20 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpHighStreetEv20 is "fail">>账簿在桌上摊到后半夜，有几笔怎么摆都差一点。天亮时执事把三本账合上，说三日内补齐；老板把票据收回袖子，账房的算盘又响了起来，一声比一声慢，铜尺还压在账页上。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>><<else>><<set $mpDone_HighStreet_20 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0) + 1)>>账目终于有了头绪：假币与赊账分开记，进货单按日期排好，缺的那一笔也对上了。执事用铜尺敲了敲账尾，说三日之期可以缓到月底；老板把袖里的票据按平，账房也停了手。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退回候事房 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[回到高街总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 21 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet to ($mpLocEvents_HighStreet or 0)>><<set _lin to (mpNpcMet("Lynne") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet)) ? "林恩" : "守夜人">>
午后的拱廊下，一个艺人敲响铜锣，灰羽小鸟从签筒里衔出一支竹签，铜板叮叮当当落进毡帽。人一多，挑担的和送冰的板车都卡在口子上。<<print _lin>>盯着消防道，说这条道堵死，后巷一着火水车就进不来。就在这时，毡帽边少了一小把铜板。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[帮他划场子 (0:12)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 21 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>><<set $mpHighStreetEv21 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv21 to "fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[混进人群抓扒手 (0:14)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 21 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpHighStreetEv21 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv21 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 21 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpHighStreetEv21 is "fail">>拱廊里的人散得比你想的快，毡帽边的铜板终究没补回来。艺人把鸟笼抱在怀里，蹲下去一枚枚捡；消防道仍旧堵着，送冰的板车在口子上按了半天铃。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><<else>><<set $mpDone_HighStreet_21 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0) + 1)>>围观的人退出一臂，消防道空了出来，毡帽边的铜板也补了回去。艺人把鸟笼挂回竹竿，钟表铺里递出一盏小灯，替他照亮场子；送冰的板车终于推过了拱廊。<<money 20>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退回候事房 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[回到高街总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 22 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet to ($mpLocEvents_HighStreet or 0)>><<set _sera to (mpNpcMet("Sera") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet)) ? "塞拉" : "修表师">><<set _lin to (mpNpcMet("Lynne") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet)) ? "林恩" : "守夜人">>
钟楼二层的裂缝斜着爬到梁下，宽的地方能塞进一枚铜板。<<print _sera>>用蜡线贴的两道标记，两天就断了，断口不齐。「墙自己在动。」她说。<<print _lin>>担心封楼要改灯号，执事则怕街面传成钟要塌。石匠的报价单压在铜盘底下，等着定夺。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[登塔量那道缝 (0:14)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 22 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpHighStreetEv22 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetEv22 to "fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 150 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<link [[补缝换新砖 (0:16)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 22 After]]>><<pass 16>><<if ($money or 0) gte 150>><<money -150>><<else>><<tiredness 3>><</if>><<set $mpHighStreetEv22 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">补缝换新砖 (0:16)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Event 22 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpHighStreetEv22 is "fail">>缝口的蜡线又断了一道，报上去的数怎么也对不上。塔身的窄梯积着灰，你下来时风从河面灌进缝口；执事把报价单折起来，说今日先拉绳，楼下的人还仰着头看。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 3>><<else>><<set $mpDone_HighStreet_22 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0) + 1)>>裂缝的深浅、受潮的那一面都记在了纸上，石匠照数开了料，行会当天就点了头。钟摆照常走着，楼下看热闹的人被绳栏挡在外头，卖花的也把摊子挪回了原处。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退回候事房 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[回到高街总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Season Extra 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet to ($mpLocEvents_HighStreet or 0)>><<set _sera to (mpNpcMet("Sera") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet)) ? "塞拉" : "修表师">><<set _lin to (mpNpcMet("Lynne") or ($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet)) ? "林恩" : "守夜人">>
换季之前，街面上的棚、幌、灯和排水沟都要重新过一遍。执事把这趟活叫「布防」，说宁可少做一件，也别在半空里赶工。<<if Time.season is "spring">>檐下的冰凌化得滴答响，排水沟里堵着一冬的落叶。<<elseif Time.season is "summer">>拱廊顶棚晒得发烫，摊棚之间要留出风道。<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">>风把落叶往廊里灌，棚绳被扯得发紧。<<else>>石板缝里冻着雪水，风灯得换成带罩的。<</if>><<print _sera>>换了一截旧绳，<<print _lin>>带着人逐盏试灯。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[带匠人巡街面 (0:14)|MP Loc HighStreet Season Extra 2 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpHighStreetSeasonOk to 1>><<else>><<set $mpHighStreetSeasonOk to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 80>><<link [[出钱雇短工 (0:12)|MP Loc HighStreet Season Extra 2 After]]>><<pass 12>><<money -80>><<set $mpHighStreetSeasonOk to 1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">出钱雇短工 (0:12)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc HighStreet Season Extra 2 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpHighStreetSeasonOk is 1>><<set $mpDone_HighStreet_Season to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_HighStreet += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_HighStreet to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_HighStreet or 0) + 1)>>你按着当季的规矩把棚绳、灯罩和排水沟一一过了一遍，匠人跟在后面补漏。收工时执事在街面图上又添了一处红圈；入夜风起，拱廊两头的新绳绷得笔直，一盏灯也没灭。<<else>>天色变得比预报快，棚布半干不干，绳子一拉就渗水。你从梯子上下来时踩滑了半级，腰侧磕在梯脚上；剩下几处只能记在纸上，等天晴再补。执事把炭笔收进袖里，没有再多说什么。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秤房 (0:02)|MP Loc HighStreet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退回候事房 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[回到高街总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc HighStreet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
